        <mxCell id="v-40" value="&lt;b&gt;Client rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Refetch after every write; never patch numbers locally&lt;br&gt;• Write payloads carry only user-edited fields; state changes go through action endpoints&lt;br&gt;• Roles from /me only show/hide controls; the Server checks again&lt;br&gt;• One shared error handler; on 409, offer to regenerate the draft&lt;br&gt;• A null metric is shown as &quot;—&quot;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#c9b458;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
